# The vendored component type packages under components/types/ ship their
# `.d.ts.gz` declarations inside `dist/` subdirectories. The repo-wide `dist`
# ignore rule would exclude them, which would leave `shopify validate
# components` missing reference data on a clean checkout. Re-include the whole
# bundled reference-data tree here (this scope contains no build output).
!**/dist/
!**/dist/**
